{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>אתו.</b> Like him in craftsmanship, but not in the wisdom of the craftsman's skill. The meaning of ובכל מלאכה is to devise devices:" "<b>ובלב כל חכם לב.</b> To do craftsmanship, for this too is found in human nature, that one brings forth from his heart profound things in the craft of measurements, and he did not learn the wisdom:" "And now he will mention all that they shall do:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:32.988275506Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}